{
  "key": 14693,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0485_T06GYM0101_cv_mentor_prebattle_rock",
      "en_US": [
        "Brock: {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}! You made it to Pewter!\r",
        "We met in Oak’s lab, but here I’m a Gym\n",
        "Leader, and you’re a challenger.\r",
        "Show me what your Rock Pokémon can do!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0485_T06GYM0101_cv_mentor_prebattle_normal",
      "en_US": [
        "Brock: {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}! Good to see you again.\r",
        "Since Oak’s lab, I’ve wondered how your\n",
        "Normal types would do against my Rock\f",
        "types.\r",
        "Let’s find out!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0485_T06GYM0101_cv_mentor_prebattle_water",
      "en_US": [
        "Misty: Well, well. The kid from Oak’s lab.\r",
        "A Water trainer, here to take the Water\n",
        "Gym’s Badge? Ha!\r",
        "Let’s see you try!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0485_T06GYM0101_cv_mentor_prebattle_electric",
      "en_US": [
        "Lt. Surge: Ten-hut! The Electric kid\n",
        "from Oak’s lab!\r",
        "This is my turf, soldier. Let’s see who’s\n",
        "packing more voltage!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0485_T06GYM0101_cv_mentor_prebattle_steel",
      "en_US": [
        "Lt. Surge: The Steel kid! Told you I’d be\n",
        "watching.\r",
        "Let’s see if that armor holds up under\n",
        "fire!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0485_T06GYM0101_cv_mentor_prebattle_grass",
      "en_US": [
        "Erika: Oh, {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}… Welcome. I’m so\n",
        "glad you came.\r",
        "I’ve been looking forward to seeing your\n",
        "Grass Pokémon again.\r",
        "Shall we?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0485_T06GYM0101_cv_mentor_prebattle_poison",
      "en_US": [
        "Koga: …You have come, as I knew you\n",
        "would.\r",
        "I have watched you from the shadows\n",
        "since Oak’s lab.\r",
        "Now show me your Poison in the open!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0485_T06GYM0101_cv_mentor_prebattle_bug",
      "en_US": [
        "Koga: Fwahaha! The Bug trainer from\n",
        "Oak’s lab.\r",
        "Most call Bug Pokémon weak. Show me why\n",
        "they are wrong!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0485_T06GYM0101_cv_mentor_prebattle_psychic",
      "en_US": [
        "Sabrina: …I saw this battle in a vision,\n",
        "the day we met in Oak’s lab.\r",
        "Two Psychic trainers. Only one leaves\n",
        "with the win."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0485_T06GYM0101_cv_mentor_prebattle_fairy",
      "en_US": [
        "Sabrina: We meet again, as I said we\n",
        "would.\r",
        "Show me whether your Fairy Pokémon\n",
        "trust you as much as I foresaw."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0485_T06GYM0101_cv_mentor_prebattle_fire",
      "en_US": [
        "Blaine: Hah! Quiz! Who’s the Fire trainer\n",
        "I met in Oak’s lab?\r",
        "Answer: you! Now let’s see if you can\n",
        "take the heat!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0485_T06GYM0101_VermilionCity_Gym_Text_LtSurgeIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "Hey, kid! What do you think you’re\n",
        "doing here?\r",
        "You won’t live long in combat!\n",
        "Not with your puny power!\r",
        "I tell you, kid, electric Pokémon\n",
        "saved me during the war!\r",
        "They zapped my enemies into\n",
        "paralysis!\r",
        "The same as I’ll do to you!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0485_T06GYM0101_VermilionCity_Gym_Text_GymGuyAdvice",
      "en_US": [
        "Yo!\n",
        "Champ in the making!\r",
        "Lt. Surge has a nickname.\r",
        "People refer to him as the\n",
        "Lightning American!\r",
        "He’s an expert on electric\n",
        "Pokémon.\r",
        "Bird/Water-type Pokémon match\n",
        "poorly against the Electric type.\r",
        "Beware of paralysis, too.\r",
        "Lt. Surge is very cautious.\r",
        "He’s locked himself in, so it won’t\n",
        "be easy getting to him."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0485_T06GYM0101_VermilionCity_Gym_Text_TuckerIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "When I was in the Army, Lt. Surge\n",
        "was my strict Co.\r",
        "He was a hard taskmaster."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0485_T06GYM0101_VermilionCity_Gym_Text_TuckerPostBattle",
      "en_US": [
        "It’s not easy opening that door.\r",
        "Lt. Surge was always famous for\n",
        "his cautious nature in the Army."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0485_T06GYM0101_GymAides_Text_VermilionCity",
      "en_US": [
        "Prof. Oak’s Aide here!\n",
        "Lt. Surge hides his door switches\f",
        "in these trash cans.\r",
        "A puzzle slows challengers down and\n",
        "makes them think before they reach\f",
        "the Leader.\r",
        "Challengers remember the Gym that\n",
        "made them think!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0485_T06GYM0101_VermilionCity_Gym_Text_GymStatue",
      "en_US": [
        "Vermilion Pokémon Gym\n",
        "Leader: Lt. Surge\r",
        "Winning Trainers:\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 7, 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0485_T06GYM0101_VermilionCity_Gym_Text_GymGuyPostVictory",
      "en_US": [
        "Whew!\n",
        "That match was electric!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0485_T06GYM0101_GymAides_Text_VermilionCityAfter",
      "en_US": [
        "With the Thunder Badge, your Gym PC\n",
        "sells Trash Cans like these.\r",
        "In your Gym they’re just for show,\n",
        "but challengers love a Gym with\f",
        "a story behind it!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0485_T06GYM0101_VermilionCity_Gym_Text_GymStatuePlayerWon",
      "en_US": [
        "Vermilion Pokémon Gym\n",
        "Leader: Lt. Surge\r",
        "Winning Trainers:\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 7, 0}, {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0485_T06GYM0101_VermilionCity_Gym_Text_NopeOnlyTrashHere",
      "en_US": [
        "Nope!\n",
        "There’s only trash here."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0485_T06GYM0101_VermilionCity_Gym_Text_LtSurgePostBattle",
      "en_US": [
        "A little word of advice, kid!\r",
        "Electricity is sure powerful!\r",
        "But, it’s useless against Ground-\n",
        "type Pokémon!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0485_T06GYM0101_VermilionCity_Gym_Text_ExplainThunderBadgeTakeThis",
      "en_US": [
        "The Thunderbadge cranks up your\n",
        "Pokémon’s Speed!\r",
        "It also lets your Pokémon Fly\n",
        "lightning-quick anytime, kid!\r",
        "You’re special, kid!\n",
        "Take this!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0485_T06GYM0101_VermilionCity_Gym_Text_ReceivedTM34FromLtSurge",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0} received TM34\n",
        "from Lt. Surge."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0485_T06GYM0101_VermilionCity_Gym_Text_ExplainTM34",
      "en_US": [
        "TM34 contains Shock Wave!\r",
        "Teach it to an Electric Pokémon!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0485_T06GYM0101_VermilionCity_Gym_Text_OnlyTrashLocksWereReset",
      "en_US": [
        "Nope!\n",
        "There’s only trash here.\r",
        "Hey!\n",
        "The electric locks were reset!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0485_T06GYM0101_VermilionCity_Gym_Text_SwitchUnderTrashFirstLockOpened",
      "en_US": [
        "Hey! There’s a switch under the\n",
        "trash! Turn it on!\r",
        "The first electric lock opened!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0485_T06GYM0101_GymHack_Text_SurgeSilverCap",
      "en_US": "Lt. Surge: Hey, kid! Catch!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0485_T06GYM0101_GymHack_Text_SurgeSilverCapAfter",
      "en_US": [
        "That’s a Silver Bottle Cap!\r",
        "In the war, we got every last volt\n",
        "out of our Pokémon!\r",
        "Pick one stat and max it out!\n",
        "That’s an order, soldier!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0485_T06GYM0101_VermilionCity_Gym_Text_MakeRoomInYourBag",
      "en_US": "Yo, kid, make room in your Bag!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0485_T06GYM0101_VermilionCity_Gym_Text_SecondLockOpened",
      "en_US": [
        "The second electric lock opened!\n",
        "The motorized door opened!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0485_T06GYM0101_GymHack_Text_GiftSentToPC",
      "en_US": [
        "Your Bag is full, so the\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0} was sent to your PC."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0485_T06GYM0101_cv_mentor_first_rock",
      "en_US": [
        "Brock: {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}! You made it!\r",
        "Your Rock types have gotten solid\n",
        "since Oak’s lab.\r",
        "Two Rock Gyms in Kanto?\n",
        "I can’t wait!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0485_T06GYM0101_cv_mentor_first_normal",
      "en_US": [
        "Brock: Good to see you again,\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}!\r",
        "Your Normal types fought well.\n",
        "Basics win battles. Stick with it!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0485_T06GYM0101_cv_mentor_first_water",
      "en_US": [
        "Misty: Hmph. So the kid from\n",
        "Oak’s lab made it all the way here.\r",
        "Your Water Pokémon are good.\n",
        "Annoyingly good.\r",
        "There’s still only room for One\n",
        "Water Gym in Kanto!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0485_T06GYM0101_cv_mentor_first_electric",
      "en_US": [
        "Lt. Surge: Well, well! The Electric\n",
        "kid from Oak’s lab!\r",
        "You’ve got a spark, I’ll give you\n",
        "that. But this is still my turf!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0485_T06GYM0101_cv_mentor_first_steel",
      "en_US": [
        "Lt. Surge: The Steel kid from\n",
        "Oak’s lab! Your team held up under\f",
        "fire.\r",
        "Still don’t buy a Steel Gym in\n",
        "Pallet, though!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0485_T06GYM0101_cv_mentor_first_grass",
      "en_US": [
        "Erika: Oh, {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}! It’s so nice\n",
        "to see you again.\r",
        "Your Grass Pokémon have grown so\n",
        "much since we met at Oak’s lab."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0485_T06GYM0101_cv_mentor_first_poison",
      "en_US": [
        "Koga: …So. The child from Oak’s\n",
        "lab grows stronger.\r",
        "I have watched you. I still will\n",
        "not make it easy for a rival."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0485_T06GYM0101_cv_mentor_first_bug",
      "en_US": [
        "Koga: Fwahaha! You’ve come far\n",
        "since Oak’s lab.\r",
        "Your Bug Pokémon surprised even\n",
        "me. A little."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0485_T06GYM0101_cv_mentor_first_psychic",
      "en_US": [
        "Sabrina: …As I foresaw at Oak’s\n",
        "lab, you came.\r",
        "I still do not like a second\n",
        "Psychic Gym. But visions do not\f",
        "ask for permission."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0485_T06GYM0101_cv_mentor_first_fairy",
      "en_US": [
        "Sabrina: We meet again, as I said\n",
        "we would.\r",
        "Your Fairy Pokémon trust you\n",
        "completely. That is rare."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0485_T06GYM0101_cv_mentor_first_fire",
      "en_US": [
        "Blaine: Hah! My favorite Fire\n",
        "trainer! Quiz! Who knew you’d make\f",
        "it this far?\r",
        "Answer: me! Wahahahah!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0485_T06GYM0101_GymCandidate_Text_SomeoneToSeeYou",
      "en_US": [
        "Hm? Someone came into the Gym\n",
        "looking for {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}…"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0485_T06GYM0101_GymCandidate_Text_NotYet",
      "en_US": [
        "Come back when you’re ready.\n",
        "My Gym isn’t going anywhere."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0485_T06GYM0101_GymCandidate_Text_TeamBreaksRules",
      "en_US": [
        "Hold on. A Gym Leader battles with\n",
        "one type, and no two alike.\r",
        "Fix your team first, then\n",
        "come back."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0485_T06GYM0101_GymCandidate_Text_GuardItemExplain",
      "en_US": [
        "When a Pokémon holds the\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, no move is\f",
        "super effective against it.\r",
        "It never wears out."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0485_T06GYM0101_GymCandidate_Text_EdgeItemExplain",
      "en_US": [
        "When a Pokémon holds the\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, its moves always\f",
        "hit for at least normal damage.\r",
        "It never wears out."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0485_T06GYM0101_Outfits_Text_ReceivedGymUniform",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0} received a\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} Gym Uniform!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0485_T06GYM0101_Outfits_Text_PutInWardrobe",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0} put it in the wardrobe\n",
        "upstairs."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0485_T06GYM0101_Text_GymHack_WrongType",
      "en_US": [
        "League Rules: Only {STRVAR_1 3, 2, 0}-type\n",
        "Pokémon may be on your team.\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} is {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}-type!\r",
        "Leave it in a PC and come back."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0485_T06GYM0101_Text_GymHack_Duplicate",
      "en_US": [
        "League Rules: No two Pokémon on\n",
        "your team may be the same species.\r",
        "You have more than one\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r",
        "Leave one in a PC and come back."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0485_T06GYM0101_Text_GymHack_DuplicateItem",
      "en_US": [
        "League Rules: No two Pokémon on\n",
        "your team may hold the same item.\r",
        "More than one is holding\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r",
        "Take one off and come back."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0485_T06GYM0101_cv_unported",
      "en_US": [
        "(Canvas DS: this part of the game\n",
        "isn’t ported yet.)"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
